  <Fragment slot="after">
      <section class="menu-content page-briefing" aria-labelledby="campaign-briefing-title">
        <h2 id="campaign-briefing-title">{t("Campaign Briefing: Road to the Capital")}</h2>
        <p class="menu-lead">{t("Road to the Capital is the main story of BATTLE TANK, a")} <a href={h("./")}>{t("free 3D tank game inspired by Battle City")}</a> {t("you play in the browser: 35 base defense and assault missions across seven regions, fought on 40×40 destructible arenas from the city outskirts to the enemy's capital citadel. Every mission you clear unlocks the next checkpoint on the map above, pays out credits, and brings your modular VANGUARD tank one step closer to its final assault.")}</p>

        <div class="menu-guide">
          <section>
            <h3>{t("Three kinds of missions")}</h3>
            <p><strong>{t("Extermination")}</strong> {t("— destroy every hostile tank on the map, including the sector boss when one is present.")} <strong>{t("Stronghold Assault")}</strong> {t("— break through the defenses and destroy the fortified enemy stronghold core.")} <strong>{t("Base Defense")}</strong> {t("— hold off attacking waves while protecting your own Command Base HQ; losing either HQ cell ends the operation.")}</p>
            <h3>{t("Credits and upgrades between missions")}</h3>
            <p>{t("Mission rewards grow as you advance, from $250 for First Contact to $1,500 for the finale. Spend credits in the Garage to raise Cannon, Chassis, Frame, Engine and Armor from Tier I to Tier V, and add standalone modules such as the 4-corner APS and the homing ATGM pod. Your progress, credits and upgrades are saved in your browser.")}</p>
            <h3>{t("Tips for the long road")}</h3>
            <p>{t("Flank heavy armor instead of trading shots with its glacis, use forest canopy to break line of sight, and and consider a Tier IV Chassis for the Coastal Wetlands: All-Terrain tracks cross water and drive over ice and sand without slowing down. Smash brick walls to open new firing lanes, but remember that reinforced concrete takes 16 hits.")}</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h3>{t("Seven regions, five missions each")}</h3>
            <ol>
              <li><strong>{t("City Outskirts (1–5)")}</strong> {t("— First Contact, Broken Avenue, Civic Shelter, Outer Gate, Remagen Bridgehead.")}</li>
              <li><strong>{t("Forest Frontier (6–10)")}</strong> {t("— Green Border, Timberline, Hidden Signals, River Watch, Deepwood Bastion.")}</li>
              <li><strong>{t("Desert Crossing (11–15)")}</strong> {t("— Dust Frontier, Dry Wells, Canyon Teeth, Mirage Array, Sunken Fortress.")}</li>
              <li><strong>{t("Coastal Wetlands (16–20)")}</strong> {t("— Salt Approach, Reed Ambush, Harbor Refuge, Breakwater, Tidal Lock.")}</li>
              <li><strong>{t("Frozen Highlands (21–25)")}</strong> {t("— Cold Ascent, White Relay, Summit Refuge, Glacier Cut, Iron Avalanche.")}</li>
              <li><strong>{t("Industrial Belt (26–30)")}</strong> {t("— Foundry Road, Freight Spine, Power Reserve, Furnace District, Capital Breach.")}</li>
              <li><strong>{t("Capital City (31–35)")}</strong> {t("— Return to the Streets, Boulevard of Steel, Last Shelter, Citadel Ring, Vanguard Dawn.")}</li>
            </ol>
          </section>
        </div>

        <h2 class="briefing-heading">{t("Sector Bosses on the road")}</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
          <article class="menu-card">
            <strong>{t("Mission 15 — Sunken Fortress")}</strong>
            <p>{t("The MAMMOTH siege dreadnought guards the desert stronghold. It is a close-range brawler with twin heavy guns and a missile pod; keep moving and hit its flanks.")}</p>
          </article>
          <article class="menu-card">
            <strong>{t("Mission 20 — Tidal Lock")}</strong>
            <p>{t("HYDRA is an amphibious rocket-artillery cruiser that keeps its distance and fires telegraphed rocket salvos. Close the gap through cover and watch the warning markers.")}</p>
          </article>
          <article class="menu-card">
            <strong>{t("Mission 25 — Iron Avalanche")}</strong>
            <p>{t("CERBERUS-T, the thermobaric siege leviathan, holds the summit fortress at the end of the Frozen Highlands.")}</p>
          </article>
          <article class="menu-card">
            <strong>{t("Mission 35 — Vanguard Dawn")}</strong>
            <p>{t("The capital citadel finale. After a second MAMMOTH at Capital Breach, the last mission throws all four Sector Bosses at you, including the TITAN rail fortress, whose directional armor means you must get behind it.")}</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-actions">
          <a class="menu-primary" href={h("./how-to-play")}>{t("How to Play →")}</a>
          <a class="menu-secondary" href={h("./walkthrough")}>{t("Campaign Walkthrough")}</a>
          <a class="menu-secondary" href={h("./enemies")}>{t("Enemy &amp; Boss Guide")}</a>
          <a class="menu-secondary" href={h("./arsenal")}>{t("Tank Arsenal &amp; Upgrades")}</a>
        </div>
      </section>
  </Fragment>

